  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Alfskin Aegis\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:50%;\" valign=\"top\"><b>Piece:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\" valign=\"top\">Shield\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:50%;\" valign=\"top\"><b>Class:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\" valign=\"top\">Ranger\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:50%;\" valign=\"top\"><b>Defense Rating:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\" valign=\"top\">varies with item level\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><b>Alfskin Aegis</b> is a ranger leather.</p>\n\n<a name=\"Attributes:\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Attributes: </span></h2>\n<p>The base item always carries:</p>\n<ul>\n<li> + Agility\n</li>\n<li> + Endurance\n</li>\n<li> + Piercing Damage\n</li>\n<li> + Block\n</li>\n<li> + Melee Damage Reflection\n</li>\n<li> + Total Mana\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Rolled copies can also pick up an extra ending. Those endings and their bonuses are listed on <a href=\"/wiki/Mythic_Suffixes\" title=\"Mythic Suffixes\">Mythic Suffixes</a>.</p>\n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>",
